WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.359 --> 00:00:08.880
<v><b>Kim:</b></v> The garden’s wonderful, I love it.

2
00:00:08.906 --> 00:00:10.640
<v><b>Leo:</b></v> Is there a garage?

3
00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:16.206
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> Oh yes, there’s a big garage over there.

4
00:00:16.594 --> 00:00:21.280
<v><b>Kim:</b></v> You lived in this house, is that right, Mrs…?

5
00:00:21.306 --> 00:00:25.953
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> Miss Travers. But call me Barbara, dear.

6
00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:30.147
Yes, I lived here. A long time ago.

7
00:00:30.535 --> 00:00:35.558
Now I live in the village. Let’s go inside the house…

8
00:00:40.671 --> 00:00:46.767
This is the living room. It’s a lovely room, very light.

9
00:00:47.648 --> 00:00:54.366
<v><b>Kim:</b></v> I love the furniture, the old sofa, the armchairs, the fireplace …

10
00:00:56.398 --> 00:00:59.207
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> And this is the library…

11
00:00:59.271 --> 00:01:02.624
<v><b>Leo:</b></v> Wow! There’s a library, Kim!

12
00:01:05.601 --> 00:01:12.138
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> And this is the kitchen. It’s very big, as you can see.

13
00:01:12.190 --> 00:01:14.015
<v><b>Kim:</b></v> Is there a dishwasher?

14
00:01:14.118 --> 00:01:18.468
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> No, there isn’t. It’s an old house, you see.

15
00:01:18.597 --> 00:01:21.730
<v><b>Leo:</b></v> Never mind. I think it’s lovely.

16
00:01:21.937 --> 00:01:24.267
Is there a bathroom downstairs?

17
00:01:24.344 --> 00:01:30.816
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> Yes, there’s one downstairs and there are three upstairs.

18
00:01:31.036 --> 00:01:34.130
<v><b>Kim:</b></v> Are there any neighbours with children?

19
00:01:34.195 --> 00:01:37.522
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> No, there aren’t any neighbours near here.

20
00:01:37.923 --> 00:01:42.026
But there are some families with children in the village.

21
00:01:42.337 --> 00:01:45.612
<v><b>Kim:</b></v> That’s great. We have two children.

22
00:01:45.638 --> 00:01:49.883
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> Very nice, dear. Now let’s go upstairs …